# Models, Serialization, Codegen

## Conventions
- ✅ Domain entities are immutable and UI-agnostic
- ✅ DTOs mirror API contracts (version-aware), suffix with `Dto`
- ✅ Mapping between DTO <-> domain via mappers
- ✅ Place files consistently:
  - entities: `lib/features/<feature>/domain/entities/`
  - DTOs: `lib/features/<feature>/data/dtos/`
  - mappers: `lib/features/<feature>/data/mappers/`

## Codegen
- ✅ Use:
  - `freezed` for unions/immutable classes
  - `json_serializable` for JSON
- ✅ Analyzer config must keep:
  - `invalid_annotation_target: ignore` (required for common `@JsonKey(...)` + Freezed patterns)
- ✅ Commands:
  - `dart run build_runner build --delete-conflicting-outputs`

## Files
- ✅ Keep one model per file where possible
- ✅ Generated parts:
  - `part '<name>.freezed.dart';`
  - `part '<name>.g.dart';`

## NEVER
- ❌ Edit generated files
- ❌ Use domain entities as API DTOs
